{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locomoto</strong> is a cosy, life-sim adventure train game where you are the conductor! Customise, manage and expand your train as well as tend to your colourful, furry passengers. Board your train and embark on a journey through beautiful landscapes, all while enjoying the soft, lofi beats of an extensive original soundtrack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328650/extras/EN_Header_Train_Life.png?t=1744196721\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328650/extras/Train-Life-720.gif?t=1744196721\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ensure your passengers have the best journey possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Invite passengers</strong> to board your train and help them reach their destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Serve your passengers</strong> to make sure they\u2019re having a comfortable journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tend to your train</strong> and prepare it for the next journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328650/extras/EN_Header_Customise_Your_Experience.png?t=1744196721\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328650/extras/Customise-your-experiece-720.gif?t=1744196721\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customise your train</strong> by decorating your wagons with furniture in different styles! Craft the furniture you need using resources scoured around the world. Using different resources to influence the colours of your crafted item. <strong>Expand your train</strong> by adding more wagons, allowing more passengers to ride along! <strong>Customise your look</strong>! Choose between a great variety of animal-like features and colours, then play around with an assorted collection of clothes, that you collect throughout your journey, to express yourself further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328650/extras/EN_Header_Explore_the_World.png?t=1744196721\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328650/extras/Explore-The-World-720.gif?t=1744196721\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, interact and <strong>engage with unique characters</strong>. Help them with their requests to gain rewards of clothes, resources and crafting-blueprints. As you befriend them, learn more about their personalities and struggles within the world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome aboard!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2328650/80b782a5954af541c9b9116f1c2c82431860ca26.jpg"},{"name":"Going Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2328650/a9dcb43e8a74c2b255e7964cfcfb759b67c78741.jpg"},{"name":"A New Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2328650/94dadf8accf2970b43bc06255c19bf7c4e121978.jpg"},{"name":"Jack of All Trades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2328650/3d56c418cb68a071f6496eb9e569709446b00b02.jpg"},{"name":"Railway Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2328650/d281544c6529469376d7a3c7ff79c5f4ec7e5cf9.jpg"},{"name":"Top of the Class","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2328650/bb989596a44eb256a65b1fccf0b198e507ec0c3e.jpg"},{"name":"Makeover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2328650/b9cdfc4507d7627543def17e378b2569c09156e6.jpg"},{"name":"A Smashing Find","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st